OL,3,ACharles Bronson denied parole for ninth
OL,4,Atime
OL,5,
OL,6,FCharles Bronson, one of the UK's
OL,7,Flongest-serving inmates, has been
OL,8,Frefused release after his ninth parole
OL,9,Fhearing.
OL,11,FBronson, 73, from Luton, has spent much
OL,12,Fof the last 50 years in prison
OL,13,Ffollowing his conviction for armed
OL,14,Frobbery in 1974, including a period at
OL,15,FHMP Woodhill in Milton Keynes.
OL,17,FThe Parole Board panel found that
OL,18,FBronson, who now uses the name Charles
OL,19,FSalvador, had committed "further
OL,20,Fincidents of violence against staff and
OL,21,Fother prisoners".
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
